WEBVTT

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:01.529
And not only does it allow
for self-expression

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.322
in totally different contexts,

00:04:03.364 --> 00:04:07.618
but digital fashion can be zero-waste
and inclusive, available to users,

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.371
regardless of their gender, size or race.

00:04:10.413 --> 00:04:11.872
I come from Croatia,

00:04:11.914 --> 00:04:14.166
a country that is nowhere
on the fashion map,

00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:18.254
yet my company is considered
one of the pioneers of this field.

00:04:18.254 --> 00:04:21.215
When we started,
we were among the few doing it.

00:04:21.215 --> 00:04:22.425
And since then,

00:04:22.425 --> 00:04:25.511
a whole new evolving market
has grown around it.

00:04:25.553 --> 00:04:27.972
Digital fashion market
is going to be huge.

00:04:27.972 --> 00:04:31.309
But from my experience,
no one knows how far it could go.